  "Correct Answer": "200",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(p=k/S\\), and \\(k=0.2\\times500=100\\), so \\(p=100/S\\). When \\(S=0.5\\), \\(p=100/0.5=200\\).",
